    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586820/extras/95f24af04616ecef671c425a235da8ab.avif?t=1681928274\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is The List?</h2><strong>The List</strong> tells the story of Jordan Grady. Attacked at a bus station, Grady killed his would-be killer in self defense. Grady is interviewed by the police for 5 days after finding a list of names on the unknown killer which included Grady's. Unable to find any connections or motives, he is let go only to be killed the following week. 3 years have passed. You are a special agent from Santa Fe investigating the Grady Case to put it to rest once and for all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586820/extras/d8bb21d910d7a7e060dd2480ca6997fc.poster.avif?t=1681928274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586820/extras/d8bb21d910d7a7e060dd2480ca6997fc.webm?t=1681928274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586820/extras/d8bb21d910d7a7e060dd2480ca6997fc.mp4?t=1681928274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><i><strong>DETECTIVE WORK</strong></i><br>Listen to what Grady has to say. By using the police database, you can search for keywords in the conversation to help form a better picture of what happened that night in West County.<br><br><strong><i>INFINITE PATHS TO THE END</i></strong><br>The List is completely non-linear as you uncover the truth. How you reach the conclusion is entirely based on the questions <strong><i>you</i></strong> ask and the words <strong><i>you</i></strong> search. How you discover the truth will be completely unique to all other players.<br><br><i><strong>DESK JOCKEY</strong></i><br>Use everything available to you on the WCPD desktop. View the Grady's Case Interviews in the Crime-TaggerPC Database, take notes, check your email, or go over the extensive Grady Case Folder and look for clues and discrepancies to help crack the case.<br><br><strong><i>A\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 A\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588</i></strong><br>As a Special Agent we expect you to take \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 seriousness. \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 needs you to \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 the database and \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588 any evidence of \u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 Do <strong><u>not</u></strong> forget this.<br><br>Good luck, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588",
